    {
      "para_index": 22,
      "text": "1. M\u1ee5c ti\u00eau c\u1ee7a Phase 7",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 32,
      "text": "2. K\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u00e3 ho\u00e0n th\u00e0nh",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 46,
      "text": "3. Nh\u1eefng ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c \u0111\u00e3 h\u1ecdc \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 48,
      "text": "3.1. Hi\u1ec3u vai tr\u00f2 c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t notification service trung t\u00e2m",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 51,
      "text": "3.2. H\u1ecdc c\u00e1ch thi\u1ebft k\u1ebf d\u1eef li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n trang cho th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 55,
      "text": "3.3. K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p d\u1eef li\u1ec7u l\u01b0u tr\u1eef v\u1edbi c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt th\u1eddi gian th\u1ef1c",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 58,
      "text": "3.4. H\u1ecdc c\u00e1ch t\u00edch h\u1ee3p s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n qua nhi\u1ec1u mi\u1ec1n nghi\u1ec7p v\u1ee5",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 61,
      "text": "3.5. H\u1ecdc c\u00e1ch qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd giao di\u1ec7n th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o \u1edf m\u1ee9c to\u00e0n \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 64,
      "text": "3.6. Hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 quy\u1ec1n s\u1edf h\u1eefu v\u00e0 d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\u00f4ng khai",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 67,
      "text": "3.7. H\u1ecdc c\u00e1ch \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 \u0111\u00fang ph\u1ea1m vi ki\u1ec3m th\u1eed",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 70,
      "text": "3.8. H\u1ecdc c\u00e1ch \u01b0u ti\u00ean Must-have v\u00e0 Stretch",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 72,
      "text": "4. Lu\u1ed3ng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng ch\u00ednh",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 81,
      "text": "5. Kh\u00f3 kh\u0103n v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch x\u1eed l\u00fd",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 86,
      "text": "6. M\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 88,
      "text": "7. H\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i v\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edbng ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 95,
      "text": "8. Bi\u1ec3u \u0111\u1ed3 use case v\u00e0 sequence",
      "style": "Normal"
    },
    {
      "para_index": 101,
